comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-22T05:28:42.055Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: complete 2790-item all-status corpus plus live release-notes searches and open/in-progress lists found no matching reader defect. pm-hybj is a closed SDK-shadowing/changelog propagation issue; pm-s2h0mq delivered default budgets. Source: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1284"
  "2026-09-22T05:46:11.336Z","harness:codex","Evidence: the real 128-item tracker regression failed before the change with an incorrect empty release summary and now passes. All 26 release-note tests pass, including partial, unreadable, and malformed receipts. A minimal-field unbounded read replaces the default-budget list-all call; incomplete evidence produces a visible warning. Historical release-note generation was also exercised against the actual tracker."
  "2026-09-22T06:33:42.177Z","harness:codex","Final focused verification: the linked release-note regression passes against real isolated tracker storage and malformed/partial receipt controls. The repository release-note generator recovered 15 closed items for the historical 2026.9.18 window instead of an empty section. The complete changed-boundary suite reached exact 100-percent statement, branch, function and line coverage. Full repository coverage and hosted delivery gates remain separate pending receipts."
  "2026-09-22T06:43:31.539Z","harness:codex","Final repository coverage passed: 725 files and 9192 tests; statements 64834/64834, branches 49506/49506, functions 13467/13467, lines 62037/62037. All exact thresholds remain 100 percent. Typecheck, ESLint, zero-clone scans, 100-percent module/export/member documentation, structural/static contracts, graph composition and record integrity passed. Temporary Node/Bun lifecycle and packed npm/npx/bunx consumers passed. Local import/transport timing is documented separately because unchanged main also exceeds budgets on this host; hosted gates and reviews are still required before merge."
  "2026-09-22T06:48:40.700Z","harness:codex","Reviewed delivery: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1286 — command-domain organization, mandatory private-export gate, package recovery and complete release evidence. Source implementation and local verification are committed; exact-head hosted checks and external review determine merge readiness."
